# This repository tracks the plugin's Source tree only.
#
# Everything is ignored by default and Source is re-included, rather than listing what to exclude:
# a deny-list silently starts tracking Binaries, Intermediate, Saved or DerivedDataCache the first
# time a build drops something new into the plugin folder.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/Source/

# Build artefacts, in case a tool ever writes them inside Source.
Source/**/Intermediate/
Source/**/Binaries/
Source/**/Saved/
Source/**/*.pdb
Source/**/*.user
